led\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Live Demo (coming soon)</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Experience Section -->\n    <section id=\"experience\" class=\"py-20 bg-base-200\" aria-labelledby=\"experience-heading\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4\">\n        <h2 id=\"experience-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Professional Experience</h2>\n        <ul class=\"timeline timeline-vertical\">\n          <!-- Infosys -->\n          <li>\n            <hr />\n            <div class=\"timeline-start timeline-box\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-bold text-primary\">Software Development Engineer</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm\">Infosys Limited</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs opacity-75\">Nov 2023 – Present</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"timeline-middle\">\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-briefcase text-primary text-2xl\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"timeline-end timeline-box\">\n              <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\">\n                <li>Received the Rookie of the Quarter award for outstanding performance and contributions as a new joinee in 2024.</li>\n                <li>Engineered an Agentic RAG Chatbot that extracts and processes Excel documents, reducing manual work by 50%.</li>\n                <li>Delivered features from concept to deployment following TDD principles with 80%+ test coverage, collaborating closely with UI/UX, QA, and DevOps teams.</li>\n                <li>Optimized Excel‑processing backend APIs, improving performance by 87% and reducing memory usage by 64%.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            <hr />\n          </li>\n          <!-- Quantiphi -->\n          <li>\n            <hr />\n            <div class=\"timeline-start timeline-box\">\n              <h3 class=\"font-bold text-primary\">Software Development Intern</h3>\n      